The tower you can't get into is indeed the Wizard's tower, and you need
to get in, kill the Wizard (NOT over water, unless a) you want to kill
him again, or b) you can breathe water), and get the Book of the Dead
that he was carrying.  _After_ doing all that, you then go to the
vibrating square, fill the candelabrum with 7 candles, activate the bell,
book, and candelabrum, and you'll be rewarded with a down stairway.

To get into the wizard's tower, you need to enter a fake wizard's level
with a magic portal in the middle.  There is no other way into the
real tower.

